<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-008" chapter-id="c-jinshu-008-jin067-xitan-xihui" source-id="s-jinshu-008-jin067-xitan-xihui">
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin067-xitan-xihui:office" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">以散騎常侍<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin067-xitan-xihui:office:m0005" ref="e5k_f2i_cog">郗曇</persName>爲北中郎將、持節、都督徐兗青冀幽五州諸軍事、徐兗二州刺史，鎮下邳。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin067-xitan-xihui:defeat" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">遣西中郎將<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin067-xitan-xihui:defeat:m0005" ref="aa6_83c_juy_D">謝萬</persName>次下蔡，北中郎將<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin067-xitan-xihui:defeat:m0015" ref="e5k_f2i_cog">郗曇</persName>次高平以擊之，王師敗績。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin067-xitan-xihui:death" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">五年春正月戊戌，大赦，賜鰥寡孤獨不能自存者，人米五斛。北中郎將、都督徐兗青冀幽五州諸軍事、徐兗二州刺史<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin067-xitan-xihui:death:m0051" ref="e5k_f2i_cog">郗曇</persName>卒。</p>
</text>
